id=tailscale_root
name=Tailscale Root
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=Lxns
description=Standalone root tailscaled with WebUI (status / peers / latency chart / installer / logs) and one-tap Action toggle. Auto hostname from device name, optional HTTP-proxy egress (auto-detects Box for Root), src_valid_mark guard keeps tproxy modules working alongside WireGuard. Config: /data/adb/tailscale/env
